 "_doc": "Tswaing Local Municipality (Delareyville) 'TAX INVOICE': masthead with the municipality's own 'VAT Registration No. 4960112813', Account Number / Statement Date / Deposit, physical address + suburb, then a ledger with columns Charge (excl VAT) | VAT | (incl VAT) in 'R 13 864.34' format: BALANCE BROUGHT FORWARD, payments, optional SUB TOTAL, RATES, REFUSE, a 'METER-NO <meter> TARIFF: ELECTRICITY ...' block (Curr = / Prev = / Cons = registers, 'Reading dates: Curr .. Prev ..', then '<kWh> kWh  R ex  R vat  R incl'), an optional 'BASIC ELECTRICITY BUSINESS' line (1 of 10 bills), water and sewer blocks, TOTAL CURRENT LEVY, and a totals row Total Charge (excl VAT) | Total VAT | Total Charge (incl VAT); a footer repeats 'EL<code> :<kWh> kWh@ <rate> = <amount>'. total_ex_vat_r = kWh line ex + basic line ex (single flat band -> standard; basic -> other_r). The electricity section is an overlay from BALANCE BROUGHT FORWARD to TOTAL CURRENT LEVY. Fingerprint: VAT 4960112813 + 'TSWAING'. IDENTITY tsg_ident_ex = printed Total Charge (excl VAT) - SUB TOTAL (the carried balance that total includes when it is printed) - every non-electricity charge line ex VAT: 0.00 on 10/10; the footer energy amount equals the kWh-line amount on 10/10. No reading-type marker. Checked on 10 bills.",
 "fingerprint": {
  "all": [
   "4960112813",
   "TSWAING"
  ],
  "any": [],
  "reject_if_text": []
